. This is a very extraordinary person, but she knows her job well."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c14300"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/49/494da7f8bd86f75da71277a67e2f6463b14e0bae6070530507bb1c05625bfda3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/82/821579f07b597046d291ebf971db02059e115342992cfff544fda7d464c7668f.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c14301","characterName":"安曇 元基","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c14301"},"originalCharacterName":"安曇 元基","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A showing promise competitive swimmer who has thrown the path of sportsman and got a job as a teacher at the all-girls school. Water is his native element, so it's not surprising that he was entrusted to train the most talented students. But Genki has a secret he's afraid to let others know about. He's a big fan of the women's swimsuits."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c14301"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e2/e2648c953a7fb7e2c2b887e465feb2d9b3ad4d55b2348d38906e5d75f31a3d4a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3e/3ec96f4d69d43beaeb5ab83ec8a49874682e2fac0e86d663ac9c1fa426c98c02.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c14302","characterName":"布城 永常","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c14302"},"originalCharacterName":"布城 永常","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","m